@ApiVault_HostAddress = https://localhost:7185
@token = REPLACE_AFTER_LOGIN

### Health
GET {{ApiVault_HostAddress}}/health

### Login
POST {{ApiVault_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "REPLACE_ME"
}

### Business areas
GET {{ApiVault_HostAddress}}/api/reference-data/business-areas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search APIs
GET {{ApiVault_HostAddress}}/api/apis?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
